Compact is the small-footprint preset for the cluster and
every instance on it: smaller volumes, lowered JetStream/KV
ceilings and scheduling requests, no monitoring stack unless
--no-monitoring=false keeps it, and, unless --no-tls=false,
no cert-manager and therefore no database backups. The
cluster choices show what this plan keeps.
The plan changes to this footprint and every check runs
again for it.
\x1b[1mSwitch to Compact?\x1b[m
